The problem is, the majority of a game's score comes from the monsters
killed, at a ratio 4*(exp value of monsters).  The status line gives us
no way of determining how much of his Xp came from kills and how much
came from wraiths/gain level/etc.  We don't even have a dump of the
monsters killed.  

We can ignore trivial things like wand engraving and eating tripe
rations and getting oracles, but we can't ignore Xp gained from killing
monsters.

I'm afraid there's no viable way of calculating his score.  Calculating
with the assumption that all Xp came from kills gives a score of 55
million or so, which is quite high.  

